  "contents": [
    {
      "id": "20705e84-252f-463d-8cff-90f5934102ee",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a frase e ligue o espanhol ao apoio em portugues.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "a18b5058-f27c-4ac9-8fac-a1df4aa4262e",
          "textContent": "<p>Observe a cena, escute e acompanhe a frase.</p><p><strong>En mi tiempo libre, suelo ir a clases de cerámica.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>No meu tempo livre, costumo ir a aulas de cerâmica.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/0b68c13ecb98479995d1bb1ef111837b_b01-ceramica-tiempo-libre.png?Expires=1794099698&Signature=M4DSVQt1mhzWVdWSa63VRyUJy6S4ROCItRu9Mo8S~AAgBkRi~zE4hq5YqEElhJ5FjhbWNr7Fprmzs2dT3GmY8ICWsL-CJbKTudvOtgnvLkJHALzbh2AYCem7cuKCaxwVesCl1c-wIAZtJr1JeGxLuDekeyvbzWiJi7ZYNplSqseBaXV8MfJvXnIVTY7M2Brx6Aq3V6ymRiV2huzvSuzA17o37QNf8vBbeCPT2Gc9fUDC34cEMqbVSSDsjncnqTFw-L1T3xmS5jQStqS0xm0KoWELb0y7mBYMthLpMxN8cG0ow9yQrjUFak98qbdq0aJZLMVBdTgV2R3CPRyzWszPHw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/8e75ff3839074848a2b41e6e19d7c18d_b01-en-mi-tiempo-libre-suelo-ir-a-clases-de-ceramica.mp3?Expires=1794099698&Signature=hAcTc0eBe1a380-66da7S7fw3PZVduL1ZBd0R1M2zWnELIzCXjCRhJ-bd3M8wBokIuPNXigC--MSiL69Ad8UZeNPyVFxslYRMsMsHttxvqRMG0AwBH7cs18wxdN48GEOyKxSJxOAfgweh-0bpjaVp9~~f4P7gto4R6IaG5y~rZ1DuizxI5B0KsPpXDF86NlsQiJ-fOOguBvMM0LBDuYzU7sgJjvMiTn5LnppQKdiRc3usPe7IsZpWkNAj1hP6uZro8B9GDyCTKjm09HVjJKmqqNj48L65fCbi7TUaAzD1PFwQRoonG~pYXk~KQHkO1F6v-zEXFIO85wwwYA9X9Jvtw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
